WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.957 --> 00:00:07.128
TRYING TO BE TRANSPARENT AND

00:00:04.259 --> 00:00:11.132
HONEST TO THE AMERICAN PEOPLE.

00:00:07.262 --> 00:00:15.637
WE APPRECIATE IT.

00:00:11.266 --> 00:00:18.873
WILLIAM DOUGLAS CAMPBELL IS THE

00:00:15.770 --> 00:00:23.545
URANIUM ONE INFORMANT.

00:00:19.007 --> 00:00:24.846
TO PROTECT HIS IDENTITY WE PUT

00:00:23.678 --> 00:00:25.947
HIM IN SHADOW.

00:00:24.979 --> 00:00:28.783
WELCOME TO THE PROGRAM.

00:00:26.080 --> 00:00:31.286
YOU WORKED AS AN OPERATIVE FOR

00:00:28.917 --> 00:00:31.586
MULTIPLE AGENCIES HOW MANY

00:00:31.419 --> 00:00:32.220
YEARS?

00:00:31.719 --> 00:00:35.523
&gt;&gt; 30 YEARS.

00:00:32.353 --> 00:00:40.562
&gt;&gt; Sean: AND YOU FIRST GOT

00:00:35.657 --> 00:00:42.030
INVOLVED WITHIN A PUTIN AND

00:00:40.695 --> 00:00:43.665
RUSSIAN OPERATION WITHIN THE

00:00:42.163 --> 00:00:49.971
UNITED STATES IN 2009, CORRECT?

00:00:43.798 --> 00:00:53.541
&gt;&gt; ACTUALLY EARLIER THAN THAT.

00:00:50.104 --> 00:00:55.176
MY WORKED HANDED OVER TO THE FBI

00:00:53.675 --> 00:00:56.844
STARTED IN FBI.

00:00:55.310 --> 00:01:00.381
I WAS UNDER FORMAL CONTRACT AND

00:00:56.978 --> 00:01:02.884
AN ASSOCIATE PARTNER WITH THE

00:01:00.515 --> 00:01:08.523
RUSSIAN GOVERNMENT AND ITS

00:01:03.017 --> 00:01:10.458
SENIOR RUSSIAN NUCLEAR

00:01:08.656 --> 00:01:10.758
RELATIONSHIP THAT WORKED WITH

00:01:10.592 --> 00:01:12.327
PUTIN.

00:01:10.892 --> 00:01:14.062
&gt;&gt; Sean: 30 YEARS YOU SERVED

00:01:12.460 --> 00:01:14.629
YOUR COUNTRY IN DANGEROUS

00:01:14.195 --> 00:01:16.764
SITUATIONS AT TIMES?

00:01:14.762 --> 00:01:18.566
&gt;&gt; YES, SIR, YOU COULD SAY THAT.

00:01:16.898 --> 00:01:19.601
&gt;&gt; Sean: LIFE THREATENING?

00:01:18.700 --> 00:01:20.702
&gt;&gt; YOU COULD SAY THAT.

00:01:19.734 --> 00:01:23.671
&gt;&gt; Sean: AT SOME POINT,

00:01:20.835 --> 00:01:24.205
MR. CAMPBELL, YOUR LIFE IS AT

00:01:23.805 --> 00:01:27.542
RISK.

00:01:24.339 --> 00:01:29.377
YOU SEE RUSSIANS INFILTRATE THE

00:01:27.675 --> 00:01:30.778
UNITED STATES OF AMERICA.

00:01:29.510 --> 00:01:32.547
LIVING WITHIN AMERICA.

00:01:30.912 --> 00:01:38.720
YOU BECAME AWARE THAT RUSSIA

00:01:32.680 --> 00:01:40.188
WANTED TO GET A FOOTHOLD IN THE

00:01:38.853 --> 00:01:41.189
URANIUM INDUSTRY AND WERE

00:01:40.321 --> 00:01:43.258
LOOKING AT URANIUM ONE.

00:01:41.322 --> 00:01:46.694
THAT DEAL WAS GOING TO GIVE THEM

00:01:43.391 --> 00:01:47.962
THAT FOOTHOLD IF IT WAS APPROVED

00:01:46.828 --> 00:01:49.297
BY 9 GOVERNMENT AGENCIES?

00:01:48.096 --> 00:01:50.732
&gt;&gt; YES, SIR.

00:01:49.430 --> 00:01:53.167
THERE WAS NO QUESTION ABOUT IT.

00:01:50.865 --> 00:01:55.470
&gt;&gt; Sean: THE FBI KNEW IT?

00:01:53.301 --> 00:01:59.140
&gt;&gt; THE BUREAU KNEW IT.

00:01:55.603 --> 00:02:03.144
THE URANIUM ONE POSITION WAS A

00:01:59.274 --> 00:02:04.746
PART OF A LONG-TERM STRATEGY BY

00:02:03.278 --> 00:02:09.284
THE RUSSIANS.

00:02:04.879 --> 00:02:13.254
&gt;&gt; Sean: DID THESE RUSSIAN

00:02:09.417 --> 00:02:12.670
CRIMINAL

00:02:12.670 --> 00:02:13.621
CRIMINA

00:02:13.388 --> 00:02:14.389
CRIMINALS.

00:02:13.755 --> 00:02:16.090
HILLARY CLINTON IS SECRETARY OF

00:02:14.522 --> 00:02:16.457
STATE AND BARACK OBAMA IS THE

00:02:16.224 --> 00:02:18.226
PRESIDENT.

00:02:16.591 --> 00:02:20.628
DID THEY EXPRESS ANY SPECIFIC

00:02:18.359 --> 00:02:22.530
CLINTON STRATEGY TO GET HER ON

00:02:20.762 --> 00:02:23.264
BOARD OR ANY OBAMA STRATEGY?

00:02:22.664 --> 00:02:25.833
&gt;&gt; THIS WAS A CRIMINAL

00:02:23.398 --> 00:02:26.267
INVESTIGATION OF PEOPLE I HAD

00:02:25.967 --> 00:02:29.470
REPORTED.

00:02:26.401 --> 00:02:32.273
YES, THE RUSSIANS AND THE UNITED

00:02:29.604 --> 00:02:35.276
STATES CONSPIRATORS STATED THE

00:02:32.407 --> 00:02:37.545
CLINTONS WERE IMPLICATED.

00:02:35.410 --> 00:02:38.313
THAT WAS NOT THE FOCUS OF WHAT I

00:02:37.679 --> 00:02:39.647
WAS DOING.

00:02:38.446 --> 00:02:41.616
I DIDN'T BELIEVE UNTIL THE

00:02:39.781 --> 00:02:43.751
URANIUM ONE APPROVAL ACTUALLY

00:02:41.749 --> 00:02:46.888
HAPPENED THAT THE INDICATIONS

00:02:43.885 --> 00:02:52.260
FROM THESE RUSSIANS WERE SOLID

00:02:47.021 --> 00:02:50.792
ABOUT THE CLINTSONS INFLUENCE

00:02:50.792 --> 00:02:50.825
ABOUT THE CLINTSONS INFLUENIN

00:02:50.825 --> 00:02:52.894
ABOUT THE CLINTSONS INFLUENING

00:02:52.393 --> 00:02:53.861
THAT DECISION.

00:02:53.027 --> 00:02:54.896
&gt;&gt; Sean: DID THEY HAVE

00:02:53.995 --> 00:02:57.298
CONFIDENCE THAT CLINTON WOULD

00:02:55.029 --> 00:02:58.099
SIGN OFF ON THIS DEAL?

00:02:57.432 --> 00:02:59.734
&gt;&gt; ABSOLUTELY CONFIDENCE.

00:02:58.232 --> 00:03:01.402
&gt;&gt; Sean: CONFIDENCE THAT OBAMA

00:02:59.867 --> 00:03:03.271
WOULD SIGN OFF ON THIS DEAL?

00:03:01.536 --> 00:03:04.605
&gt;&gt; THEY WERE QUITE SURE THAT

00:03:03.404 --> 00:03:06.908
OBAMA AND THE ADMINISTRATION

00:03:04.739 --> 00:03:10.345
WHOM THEY HAD DEEMED AND LABELED

00:03:07.041 --> 00:03:14.282
AS BEING VERY WEAK MULTIPLE

00:03:10.478 --> 00:03:15.450
TIMES WOULD RESPOND FAVORABLY.

00:03:14.415 --> 00:03:16.484
&gt;&gt; Sean: ARE A PATRIOTIC

00:03:15.583 --> 00:03:19.387
AMERICAN AND YOU ARE RISKING

00:03:16.617 --> 00:03:21.589
YOUR LIFE.

00:03:19.520 --> 00:03:22.390
HEARING THAT THE COUNTRY AND THE

00:03:21.723 --> 00:03:26.627
PRESIDENT IS SECRETARY OF STATE

00:03:22.523 --> 00:03:28.162
ARE WEAK, I WOULD FEEL BAD FOR

00:03:26.761 --> 00:03:31.666
MY COUNTRY.

00:03:28.296 --> 00:03:34.669
&gt;&gt; I REACTED TO IT AND

00:03:31.799 --> 00:03:37.271
CHALLENGED MY FBI HANDLER AS TO

00:03:34.802 --> 00:03:40.908
WHY THE HELL ALL OF THE WORK

00:03:37.405 --> 00:03:42.944
DONE MONITORING THE SUCCESSFUL

00:03:41.042 --> 00:03:45.580
RUSSIAN STRATEGY I REPORTED

00:03:43.077 --> 00:03:49.417
SINCE 2006 HAD FALLEN BY THE WAY

00:03:45.713 --> 00:03:49.751
SIDE AND APPROVAL WAS ALLOWED TO

00:03:49.550 --> 00:03:53.454
PROCEED.

00:03:49.884 --> 00:03:54.255
&gt;&gt; Sean: WHAT WAS THE POSSIBLE

00:03:53.588 --> 00:03:58.092
EXPLANATION?

00:03:54.389 --> 00:04:01.195
I CAN'T EXPECT ANY REASONABLE

00:03:58.226 --> 00:04:04.932
EXPLANATION WHY WE WOULD HAND

00:04:01.329 --> 00:04:05.266
OVER URANIUM WHEN WE DON'T HAVE

00:04:05.066 --> 00:04:08.269
ENOUGH?

00:04:05.400 --> 00:04:08.736
&gt;&gt; THEY WERE ACCOUNTABLE TO

00:04:08.403 --> 00:04:09.771
ROBERT MUELLER.

00:04:08.870 --> 00:04:12.039
&gt;&gt; Sean: THE FBI DIRECTOR.

00:04:09.904 --> 00:04:12.440
&gt;&gt; WHO WAS OVERSEEING MY

00:04:12.173 --> 00:04:16.411
OPERATION.

00:04:12.573 --> 00:04:19.180
LOOKED AT ME AND CONVEYED TO ME

00:04:16.544 --> 00:04:19.547
FRUSTRATION AND SAID, ASK YOUR

00:04:19.313 --> 00:04:23.017
POLITICS.

00:04:19.680 --> 00:04:23.851
&gt;&gt; Sean: IT TAKES MY BREATH

00:04:23.151 --> 00:04:27.889
AWAY.

00:04:23.985 --> 00:04:29.690
THIS IS AN EPIC, THE MOST

00:04:28.022 --> 00:04:33.327
SPECTACULAR FAILURE.

00:04:29.824 --> 00:04:34.829
CAN YOU CONCLUDE, WHAT IS THE

00:04:33.461 --> 00:04:38.065
POSSIBLE MOTIVATION FOR PEOPLE

00:04:34.962 --> 00:04:38.399
NOT TO DO THEIR JOB AT THIS HIGH

00:04:38.199 --> 00:04:40.234
LEVEL?

00:04:38.533 --> 00:04:40.802
THIS IS KEY TO AMERICA'S

00:04:40.368 --> 00:04:43.604
NATIONAL SECURITY?

00:04:40.935 --> 00:04:45.173
&gt;&gt; IT WAS POLITICAL AND THEY

00:04:43.738 --> 00:04:47.041
BELIEVED THAT HILLARY CLINTON

00:04:45.306 --> 00:04:48.876
WOULD BE ELECTED PRESIDENT.

00:04:47.175 --> 00:04:50.978
THEY WERE GUN-SHY.

00:04:49.010 --> 00:04:51.913
THEY WERE POLITICAL.

00:04:51.112 --> 00:04:55.016
AND THEY TURNED THEIR BACK ON

00:04:52.046 --> 00:04:56.651
THE COUNTRY IN MY OPINION.

00:04:55.149 --> 00:04:58.453
&gt;&gt; Sean: THANKS FOR TELLING US

